Sommelier 126 forwards Xwayland's first buffer before acknowledging the
initial xdg_surface.configure. Weston rejects it with
"xdg_surface has never been configured".

Defer X11 buffer attachment and commits until the configure is acknowledged,
and send the initial bufferless commit after assigning the xdg role.
Applied only to the VM test's Sommelier, never to the shipped image.

